our ingredients using <strong>powerful recipes</strong>, creating space to serve even more food! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random special events</strong> provide opportunities to change each and every detail of your cards: the colours, calories, effects, how you trigger those effects, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each starting deck has a <strong>unique and powerful trinket</strong> that deeply impacts how it plays, and you'll <strong>find more trinkets</strong> to mix and match throughout your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presiding over each location is a <strong>memorable boss with a unique ability</strong>. When big numbers aren't enough, you'll have to get creative! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs to <strong>unlock more</strong> starting decks, trinkets, and release even more cards into the pool for future runs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your favourite decks to take on <strong>special challenges</strong> and earn coveted stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> and <strong>dozens upon dozens of mid-game events and upgrades,</strong> no two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/f4198992df802d61d5ac3c64cc36b825.avif?t=1764730911\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Shook Loose"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/681f0534ab60b173885c4394c20815cb3ceacef0/header.jpg?t=1764730911","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_r